#: starlingx_dashboard/dashboards/admin/datanets/datanets/forms.py:55
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum MTU value of any associated tenant network.  Worker "
"node data interface MTU values must be large enough to support the tenant "
"MTU plus any additional provider encapsulation headers.  For example, VXLAN "
"provider MTU of 1500 requires a minimum data interface MTU of 1574 bytes "
"(1600 bytes is recommended."
msgstr ""
"指定任何关联租户网络的最大 MTU 值。工作节点数据接口的 MTU 值必须足够大，以支"
"持租户 MTU 加上任何额外的提供者封装头。例如，VXLAN 提供者 MTU 为 1500 时，数"
"据接口 MTU 至少需要 1574 字节（建议 1600 字节）。"

