#: starlingx_dashboard/dashboards/admin/inventory/tables.py:221
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<b>WARNING</b>: This will cause an uncontrolled switch of services on host "
"'%s'.\n"
"\n"
"To avoid service outages, click 'Cancel' and use 'Lock Host' to gracefully "
"migrate resources away from this host. ONLY use 'Force Lock Host' if 'Lock "
"Host' is unsuccessful and this host MUST be locked.\n"
"\n"
"If you proceed, then this action will be logged and cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"<b>警告</b>：这将导致主机 '%s' 上的服务发生不受控的切换。\n"
"\n"
"为避免服务中断，请点击 'Cancel' 并使用 'Lock Host' 将资源平稳地从此主机迁移"
"走。仅当 'Lock Host' 失败且此主机必须被锁定时，才使用 'Force Lock Host'。\n"
"\n"
"如果继续，此操作将被记录且无法撤消。"

#: starlingx_dashboard/dashboards/admin/inventory/tables.py:232
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<b>WARNING</b>: This will cause a service OUTAGE for all Applications "
"currently using resources on '%s'.\n"
"\n"
"To avoid service outages, click 'Cancel' and use 'Lock Host' to gracefully "
"migrate resources away from this host. ONLY use 'Force Lock Host' if 'Lock "
"Host' is unsuccessful and this host MUST be locked.\n"
"\n"
"If you proceed, then this action will be logged and cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"<b>警告</b>：这将导致当前使用 '%s' 上资源的所有应用程序发生服务中断。\n"
"\n"
"为避免服务中断，请点击 'Cancel' 并使用 'Lock Host' 将资源平稳地从此主机迁移"
"走。仅当 'Lock Host' 失败且此主机必须被锁定时，才使用 'Force Lock Host'。\n"
"\n"
"如果继续，此操作将被记录且无法撤消。"

#: starlingx_dashboard/dashboards/admin/inventory/tables.py:243
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<b>WARNING</b>: This will cause an uncontrolled loss of storage services on "
"host '%s'.\n"
"\n"
"To avoid service outages, click 'Cancel' and use 'Lock Host' to gracefully "
"migrate resources away from this host. ONLY use 'Force Lock Host' if 'Lock "
"Host' is unsuccessful and this host MUST be locked.\n"
"\n"
"If you proceed, then this action will be logged and cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"<b>警告</b>：这将导致主机 '%s' 上的存储服务发生不受控的丢失。\n"
"\n"
"为避免服务中断，请点击 'Cancel' 并使用 'Lock Host' 将资源平稳地从此主机迁移"
"走。仅当 'Lock Host' 失败且此主机必须被锁定时，才使用 'Force Lock Host'。\n"
"\n"
"如果继续，此操作将被记录且无法撤消。"

